  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lightsmith SCALE platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lightsmith&#x2019;s SCALE project (Systemic Capital for Adaptation Localization and Expansion) will develop and launch an integrated investment platform for climate adaptation investments that aims to mobilize up to $500m in private capital to climate adaptation solutions and technologies in developing countries. The Project will serve as a response to the urgent need to increase investments in climate and nature in developing countries. Sufficient finance will enable both public and private actors to implement their priority adaptation measures and manage the risks and impacts from a changing climate, while also pursuing sustainable development goals.
The objective of the project is to contribute to investments in climate mitigation, climate adaptation and nature, as well as creating jobs, with a special emphasis on women-led companies, and contributing to improved local livelihoods through sustainable management of agricultural land, better water quality and training/support for local farmers on climate adaptation technologies.</narrative>
  </description>
